-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (distinguished variable, free-variable function, and substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G\\)</span> (Henkin-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"67317965f7ebd660\" href=\"?note=67317965f7ebd660\" title=\"92-df-henkin-sentence\">92-df-henkin-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\theta_H\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0),qquad\n\\theta_H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta_H)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\},\\\\\n&amp;Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl[\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\nH\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta_H,\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\theta_H\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0),qquad\n\\theta_H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta_H)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\},\\\\\n&amp;Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl[\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\nH\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta_H,\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{HenkinSent}_G(H)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_H=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\">\\(\\theta_H=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\)</span>表达“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>是一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-可证句的Gödel码”</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> : Henkin句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>断言&quot;我可证&quot;</li>\n<li>对角化把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>自身的编码数码代入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>结果是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash H\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash H\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li>与Gödel句子对比：这里取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_H=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\">\\(\\theta_H=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\)</span>，Gödel句取其否定</li>\n<li>构造由对角引理保证，不能用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\ulcorner\\theta_H\\urcorner)\">\\(d(\\ulcorner\\theta_H\\urcorner)\\)</span>的一次直接自代入冒充最终自有码固定点</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-henkin-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"67317965f7ebd660","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-henkin-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"